{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"41":"Types of Blood-Wit (Kitab Al-Diyat)"},"section_detail":{"41":{"hadithnumber_first":4494,"hadithnumber_last":4595,"arabicnumber_first":4494,"arabicnumber_last":4595,"name_native":"كتاب الديات"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4500,"arabicnumber":4500,"text":"حدثنا عبيد الله بن عمر بن ميسرة، حدثنا يحيى بن سعيد، قال حدثني جامع بن مطر، حدثني علقمة بن وايل، باسناده ومعناه","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Muslim (1680)"}],"reference":{"book":41,"hadith":7}}]}